<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Learner paper · 繁體</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Learner paper · 繁體</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. How many people are in the speaker’s family?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三個人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四個人</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五個人</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. Who stays home and cooks on Saturday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 哥哥</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Who is on Grandfather’s left?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. What is the new student’s family name?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 王</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 馬</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Where do the students eat lunch?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 食堂</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操場</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where should students put their bags?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 椅子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 桌子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 地上</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How many books may the student borrow at one time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一本</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩本</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三本</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Where will today’s PE lesson take place?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 圖書館</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操場</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. What should students do first?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 寫名字</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打開書</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看答案</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When should the student meet the teacher?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午兩點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午一點四十五</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午兩點十五</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What food does the customer finally order?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 麪包</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 麪條</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 包子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. How many cups of HOT TEA are requested?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五杯</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. Which fruit does the customer choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 蘋果</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 香蕉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 橙子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. How much change does the customer receive?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一塊</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which item belongs to the older sister?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 圍巾</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 帽子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 外套</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. When do they agree to meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午八點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中午十二點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When should the girl call?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What color are the boy’s sports shoes?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 黑色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 紅色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What will the boy do on Wednesday afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去公園</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 游泳</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看電影</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the girl do BEFORE playing ball?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 畫畫</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 游泳</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. In which month is Tian Le’s birthday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：田樂<br>學校：青禾學校<br>生日：六月十日<br>哥哥生日：十月五日<br>喜歡：看書、打籃球<br>想認識喜歡運動的朋友。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十月</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六月</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十二月</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. How many people are in Xiaoxia’s family?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫小夏。我家有六個人：爺爺、奶奶、爸爸、媽媽、弟弟和我。我們住在學校旁邊。弟弟明年也要上學。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四個人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五個人</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六個人</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. Where does the mother work?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我們家的工作地點<br>爸爸：飯店，做飯。<br>媽媽：學校，教英語。<br>姐姐：商店，賣衣服。<br>星期日晚上，我們常在家一起喫飯。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 學校</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 飯店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 商店</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who will Xiaowu take a walk with after dinner?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">阿東：<br>我今天晚上不去你家了。哥哥要工作，爸爸媽媽要去買東西。我在家和妹妹喫飯，飯後和妹妹一起散步。<br>小武</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爸爸媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妹妹</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Where should Ma Li sit?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新座位<br>小青：門旁邊。<br>馬力：窗戶旁邊。<br>田樂：老師前面的第一排。<br>下週一請大家按這個安排坐，不要拿錯別人的書。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 窗戶旁邊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 門旁邊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 第一排</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. When can students borrow books on Thursday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">學校圖書館通知<br>星期四上午不開門，下午兩點到五點可以借書。還書也請在這個時間來。星期五上午九點正常開門。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上七點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Where is the English book?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同桌：<br>你的英語書在後面的書架上，中文書在桌子上，練習本在椅子上。我先去喫飯，你拿到書以後來找我。<br>小蘇</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 桌子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 椅子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 書架上</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What should Tian Ming do?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">放學前的工作<br>趙平：擦黑板。<br>田明：關窗戶。<br>小蘇：把書放到書架上。<br>請做完以後再回家。今天老師在辦公室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 關窗戶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 擦黑板</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把書放好</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Where should students go if it rains?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">二班通知<br>明天體育課，請大家下午兩點到操場，不要在教室等。帶水，穿運動鞋。下雨就改在體育館，時間不變。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 體育館</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操場</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does the break start?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">週五上午<br>8:00—9:00 中文課<br>9:00—10:00 英語課<br>10:00—10:30 休息<br>10:30—11:30 數學課<br>十一點半以後喫午飯。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十點</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. Which drink is NOT sold today?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">青禾食堂早餐<br>麪包：三元一個<br>包子：兩元一個<br>熱茶：兩元一杯<br>牛奶：四元一杯<br>早上七點開始賣。今天不賣咖啡。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 咖啡</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 熱茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 牛奶</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which item has TWO portions on the receipt?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">午飯小票<br>米飯：兩份<br>麪條：一份<br>水：一瓶<br>兩份米飯放在一起，麪條另外裝。請拿好小票，到窗口取餐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 麪條</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米飯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What does Xiaohe ask Dad NOT to add?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸：<br>今天我想喫麪條，不想喫雞蛋。請給我加一些青菜，不要加雞蛋。弟弟想喫米飯。我們十二點到家。<br>小禾</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 青菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米飯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 雞蛋</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Who wants tea without sugar?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">請按這個單子買飲料：<br>爸爸：不加糖的茶。<br>媽媽：熱咖啡。<br>弟弟：蘋果汁。<br>買好後放在桌上，別拿錯了。謝謝！</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 媽媽</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 弟弟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. Which T-shirt should Xiaofang collect for Aping?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：<br>我在商店買了一件大號黃色T恤，請你幫我拿回來。中號綠色那件是小田的，不要拿錯。我的名字在袋子上。<br>阿平</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中號綠色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 大號黃色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小號黃色</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When does Xiaoyu need to go home?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小田：<br>週日我下午四點去你家看書。五點半我要回家喫飯，不能留到六點。你覺得四點去可以嗎？<br>小余</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午六點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五點半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. On which evening is the writer explicitly free to meet friends?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我的晚上安排<br>週一：上畫畫課。<br>週二：去游泳。<br>週三：在家，有空，可以和朋友見面。<br>週四：和家人一起喫飯。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 週三</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 週一</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 週二</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which item is Xiaotian looking for?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">找衣服<br>我把一件綠色毛衣忘在公園了，上面寫着“小田”。門口的白外套是小方的，不是我的。看到綠毛衣請告訴我。<br>小田</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 綠色毛衣</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 藍帽子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. Where does the singing group meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">唱歌小組<br>喜歡唱歌的同學，週四下午四點到二樓教室。王老師教大家唱新歌。畫畫小組在一樓，不要走錯地方。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一樓</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三樓</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二樓</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. Which activity do BOTH friends like?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">李平：我喜歡跳舞，不喜歡畫畫。<br>周月：我喜歡畫畫，也喜歡跳舞。<br>兩人想找一個都喜歡的活動，星期天下午一起去。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 跳舞</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 畫畫</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 游泳</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Arrange a reading visit</h2><p>Reply in Chinese to your classmate. Say whether you can join the Wednesday reading visit, give a time or propose another day, and ask one question about the visit. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may invent personal details.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：你好！星期三放學後一起去圖書館看書，好嗎？你三點還是四點有空？<br>小葉</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Wednesday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or an alternative day.</li><li>Ask one relevant question about the visit.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a pen friend</h2><p>Read Heyue’s fictional message. Introduce Heyue in Chinese to another classmate, using third-person wording or the name. Include name and age, school and class starting time, and at least one preference. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">你好！我叫何月，今年十四歲，在青禾學校二班上學。我們上午八點半上課。我喜歡看書，也喜歡游泳，不喜歡唱歌。希望認識新朋友！</p></div><ul><li>Identify Heyue by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and class starting time.</li><li>Give at least one preference consistent with the message.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Plan an activity with a new friend</h2><p>Answer four recorded prompts in Chinese. Each plays twice, then allows 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Use real or invented information. The four responses form ONE task out of eight. This is fixed-prompt practice, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A new friend asks about your family, interests and school day, then suggests a weekend outing.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Describe a Thursday at school</h2><p>Introduce the fictional student’s Thursday in Chinese from the card. Include the student’s name, school and at least one class time, and an after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. Simple sentences are sufficient; no minimum recording length applies.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">許樂的星期四<br>學校：青禾學校<br>上午八點半：開始上課<br>中午十二點：和同學在食堂喫飯<br>下午四點：下課<br>下課後：和朋友在操場打籃球</p></div><ul><li>Identify Xu Le.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity on the card.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>